# Compile the dotfiles manifests with wits and deploy them with dotdrop.
#
# Requires `wits` (the compiler) and `pipx-apps` (which brings dotdrop). No
# `unless`: dotdrop decides per file what needs writing, so the only honest
# probe is running it, and re-entry costs one generate plus one install.
kind: action
capabilities: develop
requires: wits, pipx-apps, dirs
